#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:19
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_CHARACTER event, generated when the user presses a character key.\n"
"Valid event functions: GetFlags, GetPosition, GetCharacter."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_CHARACTER 事件，当处理用户按下字符键时。\n"
"有效的事件函数有 GetFlags、GetPosition、GetCharacter。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:23
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_DELETE event, generated when the user presses the backspace or delete key.\n"
"Valid event functions: GetFlags, GetPosition"
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_DELETE 事件，当用户按下退格键或删除键时。\n"
"有效的事件函数 获取标志（GetFlags）、获取位置（GetPosition"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:27
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_RETURN event, generated when the user presses the return key.\n"
"Valid event functions: GetFlags, GetPosition."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_RETURN 事件，当用户按下返回键时。\n"
"有效的事件函数有 获取标志（GetFlags）、获取位置（GetPosition）。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:31
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLE_CHANGED event, generated when styling has been applied to the control.\n"
"Valid event functions: GetPosition, GetRange."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLE_CHANGED 事件，当控件应用了样式时。\n"
"有效的事件函数 获取位置（GetPosition）、获取范围（GetRange）。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:35
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLESHEET_CHANGING event, generated when the control's stylesheet has changed,\n"
"for example the user added, edited or deleted a style.\n"
"Valid event functions: GetRange, GetPosition."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLESHEET_CHANGING 事件，当控件的样式表发生变化时，\n"
"例如，用户添加、编辑或删除了样式。\n"
"有效的事件函数有 获取范围（GetRange）、获取位置（GetPosition）。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:40
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLESHEET_REPLACING event, generated when the control's stylesheet is about to be replaced\n"
"for example when a file is loaded into the control.\n"
"Valid event functions: Veto, GetOldStyleSheet, GetNewStyleSheet."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLESHEET_REPLACING 事件，当控件的样式表即将被替换时，\n"
"例如，在控件加载文件时。\n"
"有效的事件函数有 Veto、GetOldStyleSheet、GetNewStyleSheet。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:45
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLESHEET_REPLACED event, generated when the control's stylesheet has been replaced\n"
"for example when a file is loaded into the control\n"
"Valid event functions: GetOldStyleSheet, GetNewStyleSheet."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_STYLESHEET_REPLACED 事件，当控件的样式表被替换时，\n"
"例如，当文件加载到控件中时\n"
"有效的事件函数： 获取旧样式表（GetOldStyleSheet）、获取新样式表（GetNewStyleSheet）。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:50
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_CONTENT_INSERTED event generated when content has been inserted into the control.\n"
"Valid event functions: GetPosition, GetRange."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_CONTENT_INSERTED 事件，当控件中插入内容时。\n"
"有效的事件函数： 获取位置（GetPosition）、获取范围（GetRange）。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:54
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_CONTENT_DELETED event, generated when content has been deleted from the control\n"
"Valid event functions: GetPosition, GetRange."
msgstr ""
"处理 wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_CONTENT_DELETED 事件，当控件中删除内容时\n"
"有效的事件函数： 获取位置（GetPosition）、获取范围（GetRange）。"

#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/controls/rich_text_ctrl_wrapper.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Process a wxEVT_COMMAND_RICHTEXT_BUFFER_RESET event, generated when the buffer has been reset by deleting all content.\n"
"You can use this to set a default style for the first new paragraph."
